mapping "W6752.1" source="W6752" target="217776008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source is a Swedish national extension of W67 SNOMED CT 217776008, subdivided by place
        (wholesale/retail, industrial, farm, other) and activity (sports, leisure, work, vital
        activities, other, unspecified). Target SNOMED CT 4318639 = (concept_code 217776008). Athena
        crosswalk W67 -> confirmed. The target is broader because it subsumes all place-activity
        combinations; no SNOMED CT children model these external-cause subdivisions. Moderate confidence :
        crosswalk-verified best available target but substantial granularity loss from the Swedish
        4th/5th-character extensions encoding orthogonal place+activity dimensions that SNOMED CT does not
        represent as separate concepts.
        """
}
